    "Title": "RESOURCE DRIVE: SMALL SHIP UNDER ATTACK",
    "TitleKey": "GoblinG_MicroTech_SupportAttackedShip_S_Title",
    "Description": "Got an urgent contract: a small cargo ship of ours is currently under attack by outlaws.\n\nOur team was able to pinpoint their location to <EM4>~mission(Location|Address)</EM4>, but they\u2019ve stopped responding to comms.\n\nHead to their location and see if you can <EM4>keep the outlaws occupied long enough for our hauler to escape</EM4>.\n\nIf the hauler is able to escape, I will personally ensure you are credited for any cargo they deliver.\n\nGood luck and do your best.\n\n\nAster Remmington\nContractor Liaison Officer\nmicroTech",
    "DescriptionKey": "GoblinG_MicroTech_SupportAttackedShip_S_Desc",
    "DisplayDescription": "Got an urgent contract: a small cargo ship of ours is currently under attack by outlaws.\n\nOur team was able to pinpoint their location to <EM4>[Location|Address]</EM4>, but they\u2019ve stopped responding to comms.\n\nHead to their location and see if you can <EM4>keep the outlaws occupied long enough for our hauler to escape</EM4>.\n\nIf the hauler is able to escape, I will personally ensure you are credited for any cargo they deliver.\n\nGood luck and do your best.\n\n\nAster Remmington\nContractor Liaison Officer\nmicroTech",
